ity before we met the queen in the  chapter 2 finale the origin was  responsible for the destruction of  countless realities but somehow he was  able to disconnect from the hive mind  and escape with his life the ever  watchful imagined order took this  opportunity to capture the origin  imprisoning him and extracting  information about the power of the cubes  we've seen how sloan interrogates  prisoners whilst a prisoner the origin  shared a cell block with another member  of the seven the paradigm but we'll get  back to that very soon eventually the  seven rescued the origin and offered him  a place in their ranks from that day  forward the origin vowed to save every  world he could and oppose the tyranny of  the last reality and the imagined order  two more members of the seven arrived  this season the sisters named the  imagined and the order i'm sure you've  noticed they literally have the same  name as the bad guys we may want to  watch these two i mean if they meet in  game they say this i'm working on our  next big heist i mean military plan that  sounds frighteningly ominous from day  one the imagined has done things her own  way she has this uncanny ability to take  a solid plan from the origin or  scientist and improve upon it her only  problem is she has no recollection of  her past her memories are a complete  blur truth is  i don't remember anything about my past  at all but i believe in what the seven  is doing  and i'm here she's assisted in the war  effort all season but spends the  majority of her time attempting to find  out about her own history at one point  we helped her access the i o database to  find more information about herself and  her sister the imagined is a strong  believer in the paradigm she's aware of  her poor reputation but firmly stands by  her friend and this is the issue we find  the seven's inability to get along is  causing serious issues there are two  major camps in the resistance those who  want paradigm to rejoin the gro