 the  mysterious geno and his links to both io  and the seven  [Music]  it's time for the final showdown the  seven have pushed back the imagined  order who will make their final stand at  the collider the mecca team leader is  officially recommissioned and sits in  our lobby screen at a secret moon base  we know the paradigm will be making  improvements to the mech and maybe some  new attire for the loopers too on the  island we have many unanswered questions  what is behind the vault doors in the  command cavern will the drift arm be  important to the story and what about  the devourers corpse all this is  happening while the seven continue to  bicker about the loyalty of the paradigm  they may be too distracted to notice the  real double cross going on here  [Music]  our questions will be answered on june  the 4th i'm adam you're awesome thanks  for watching

